IA formula da kuma dogara da cikakken shekarun barin aiki na 67. Shi ba ya lissafa AIME daga albashi, ƙara bayan COLAs, tabbatar da aiki kudi ko riba, ko siffar haraji, Medicare premiums, iyali amfãni, rashin iya aiki ko tsira amfãni. Binciki ku sanarwa na ofishin Social Security da kuma amfani da SSA na estimator ga wani mutum kimantawa. Wannan kayan aiki na bayar da bayanai na musamman, ba shawara kudi.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
